<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div><font face="arial">This is a friendly reminder that you have requested an ASU accompanist for your live audition on DATE. Please submit your audition program in the following format:</font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Title</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Key in which you are singing</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Composer</span></li></ul></div><div><span style="font-family: arial;">Voice applicants who have requested an ASU accompanist for the audition are required to bring piano scores of their pieces to the audition for the pianist. Scores should be clearly marked, double-sided and in a three-ring binder.</span></div><div><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><font face="arial">Please email this repertoire information to <a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">musicadmissions@asu.edu</a> <b>no later than DATE</b>.<br><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Julie Stephens</b></div></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" color="#999999">Coordinator, Academic Affairs + Admissions</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</b></font><b style="color: rgb(255, 204, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts&nbsp;</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">P.O. Box 870405 |&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">Tempe, Arizona 85287-0405</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#999999">Phone: 480-965-5069</font></div><div><span style="font-size: medium;"><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>